# Ironveil Lab — training-01 sshd configuration
# Lab machine: wide open on purpose, reset every night. Do not copy to prod.

Port 22
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0
PermitRootLogin no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PasswordAuthentication yes
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
UsePAM yes
X11Forwarding no
PrintMotd yes
Subsystem sftp /usr/lib/openssh/sftp-server
